<<<
Kaffir is the now usual form, Caffre a more or less disused one, & Kafir (pron. kah-) is a more correct spelling. Kaiser. Pronounce kiz-. kale, kail.
===
*Kaffir* is the now usual form, *Caffre* a more or less disused one, & *Kafir* (pron. kah-) is a more correct spelling.

**Kaiser.** Pronounce kīz-.

**kale, kail.**
>>>

<<<
The first is treated by the OED as the standard form, & kail as a Scotch variant. The corresponding Southern-English word is borecole. kalendar, kalends. See CALENDAR.
===
The first is treated by the OED as the standard form, & *kail* as a Scotch variant. The corresponding Southern-English word is *borecole*.

**kalendar, kalends.** See ^^CALENDAR^^.
>>>

